<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "0000" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr84\盗難車.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢眠い.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Assistant Inspector Ise</STYLE>, sorry to bother you, but..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Ah, sorry. What is it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"A report of a stolen vehicle came in a moment ago..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"A stolen vehicle? Here in Motoki-cho?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Now there's something you don't see often."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\手紙.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "600" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"A white minivan, the vehicle used for setting up the stalls at Chuo Park... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">They stole quite a conspicuous one, didn't they."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Assistant Inspector</STYLE>, let's get out on the search first thing tomorrow."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"What are you talking about! We search right now!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　The person it was stolen from is in trouble!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hold on, please... <STYLE ID="1">Assistant Inspector</STYLE>, you've been working too much lately.
{PAUSE ""}
You ought to rest a little..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"If we don't clear away small incidents like this one, steadily, one at a time...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢眠い.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Hm... damn..."</STYLE><PG>
"Look, you've hardly slept, have you.
{PAUSE ""}
And even if we went searching now, at this hour it's impossible."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm... all right... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Damn... and I work the way I do every day for times exactly like this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―It's simply that you always work too much.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "0000,人物1,アイテム1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
